sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as Tab A
  participant API as Backend API
  participant DB as Database
  participant S as Socket.IO
  participant B as Tab B
  participant Cache as RTK Query Cache

  A->>API: PATCH /reports/settings { isEnabled }
  API->>API: validate request body
  API->>DB: update report setting
  DB-->>API: updated setting
  API->>S: emit report:settings-updated to user room
  API-->>A: 200 updated setting
  A->>Cache: invalidate report tag from mutation
  S-->>B: report:settings-updated
  B->>Cache: invalidate report tag
  Cache->>API: refetch reports/settings data when subscribed
  API-->>Cache: latest report data
  Cache-->>B: render latest state

